<%# The match chat (piece 12; task cyvasse-live-chat). Locals: match,
    opponent. It shows the pair's whole conversation, not only this match's
    messages, so talk carries on from match to match; what is sent here
    records the match. Live over the pair's stream (chat/_thread). Only the
    two players ever reach this page. %>
<section class="card p-4 space-y-3" aria-labelledby="match-chat-heading" data-match-chat>
  <h2 id="match-chat-heading" class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Chat with <%= opponent.player_name %></h2>
  <%= render "chat/thread", thread: ChatThread.new(current_user, opponent), match:,
        form_url: match_messages_path(match) %>
</section>
